{"2191810":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Hexdrive","steam_appid":2191810,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexdrive is a high-speed endurance racing game about overtaking, managing resources and creating builds to fit your playstyle!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE THE RACE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Eco, Race, and Attack power modes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overdrive offers desperate speed at a permanent cost to your Core capacity.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR HEX<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend race earnings across a hexagonal strategy lattice.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape a car around your preferred racing strategy.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT THROUGH THE RACE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against 20 rivals across long, multi-region routes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rivals can make mistakes, suffer damage, and retire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four approximately 15-minute endurance routes<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A field of 20 active rivals<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy, heat, damage, repair, and Overdrive management<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slipstream harvesting and clean-overtake combos<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent garage upgrades and the expansive HEX skill tree<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable keyboard and controller controls<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable assists, sensitivity, HUD scale, quality, and reduced-flash settings<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexdrive is a high-speed endurance racing game about overtaking, managing resources and creating builds to fit your playstyle!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE THE RACE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Eco, Race, and Attack power modes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overdrive offers desperate speed at a permanent cost to your Core capacity.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR HEX<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend race earnings across a hexagonal strategy lattice.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape a car around your preferred racing strategy.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT THROUGH THE RACE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against 20 rivals across long, multi-region routes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rivals can make mistakes, suffer damage, and retire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four approximately 15-minute endurance routes<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A field of 20 active rivals<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy, heat, damage, repair, and Overdrive management<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slipstream harvesting and clean-overtake combos<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent garage upgrades and the expansive HEX skill tree<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable keyboard and controller controls<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable assists, sensitivity, HUD scale, quality, and reduced-flash settings<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Hexdrive is a high-speed endurance racing game where every decision matters. Overtake rivals, manage energy, heat and damage, and build your machine through the HEX lattice to survive long, high-speed races.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2191810\/4019f5e75e43